In generated projects, engine/, tools/ and vendor/ correspond to kit/engine/,
kit/tools/ and kit/vendor/ in the source repository. Copied files retain their
licenses; user-created files are not automatically licensed by this notice.

See LICENSE.zh-CN.md for a non-authoritative Chinese explanation. The full
license texts control; explanatory examples do not add to or override them.
